{"content":[{"c":["PEDAIAH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Maternal grandfather of Judah’s King Jehoiakim. Pedaiah was from Rumah (",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.23.36","r":"2Kgs.23.36","rawR":"2Kgs.23.36","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.23.36","value":"2Kgs.23.36"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 23:36"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Jeconiah’s third son (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.3.18-19","r":"1Chr.3.18-19","rawR":"1Chr.3.18-19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.3.18-19","value":"1Chr.3.18-19"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 3:18-19"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Joel’s father from the half-tribe of Manasseh (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.27.20","r":"1Chr.27.20","rawR":"1Chr.27.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.27.20","value":"1Chr.27.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 27:20"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Parosh’s son, who worked with the temple servants in repairing the Jerusalem wall opposite the Water Gate (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.3.25","r":"Neh.3.25","rawR":"Neh.3.25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.3.25","value":"Neh.3.25"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 3:25"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. One who stood beside Ezra during the public reading of the Law (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.8.4","r":"Neh.8.4","rawR":"Neh.8.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.8.4","value":"Neh.8.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 8:4"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["6. Kolaiah’s son and Joed’s father (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.7","r":"Neh.11.7","rawR":"Neh.11.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.7","value":"Neh.11.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:7"},"). He was a member of Benjamin’s tribe and lived in Jerusalem after the return from exile."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["7. Levite appointed by Nehemiah as treasurer of the storehouse to distribute grain, wine, and oil to the priests who served in the temple (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.13.13","r":"Neh.13.13","rawR":"Neh.13.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.13.13","value":"Neh.13.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 13:13"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Pedaiah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Kgs 23:36","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Kgs.23.36","rawQueryValue":"2Kgs.23.36","sourceRefExact":"2Kgs.23.36"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 3:18-19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.3.18-19","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.3.18-19","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.3.18-19"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 27:20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.27.20","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.27.20","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.27.20"},{"anchorText":"Neh 3:25","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.3.25","rawQueryValue":"Neh.3.25","sourceRefExact":"Neh.3.25"},{"anchorText":"Neh 8:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.8.4","rawQueryValue":"Neh.8.4","sourceRefExact":"Neh.8.4"},{"anchorText":"Neh 11:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.11.7","rawQueryValue":"Neh.11.7","sourceRefExact":"Neh.11.7"},{"anchorText":"Neh 13:13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.13.13","rawQueryValue":"Neh.13.13","sourceRefExact":"Neh.13.13"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"4f8b9d63366de66aff751bcc183e81d0914bb6d37da52b590957acea47731768","sourceItemName":"Pedaiah","sourceItemOrder":81,"sourceMember":"Articles/P.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Pedaiah","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Pedaiah","title":"Pedaiah","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}